{"3625950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shellborne", "steam_appid": 3625950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: <strong>Shellborne</strong> is currently in the <u><strong>beta</strong> <strong>phase</strong></u>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shellborne</strong> is a student‑made, completely <strong>free to play</strong>, co‑op adventure—no paywalls, just pure turtle‑powered fun. <br><br>If you want to support us, join our community discord and give us feedback. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1771920394\" width=1094 height=404 /></span>Collect Resources and Remove Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest wood, mine stone, and gather berries,  <br>then load them onto your trusty turtle to carry for you. <br>Smash through debris and rebuild bridges to carve out a safe route for your turtle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.poster.avif?t=1771920394\" width=660 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.webm?t=1771920394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.mp4?t=1771920394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The evil fog hunts your turtle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living wall of mist moves toward you, hungry for your magical turtle.  <br>It sends Spirits to slow you down - keep them away and keep running. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1771920394\" width=1094 height=404 /></span>Work together and communicate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination is key as you can only carry one tool at a time.<br>Discuss roles and swap gear at the right moment to clear the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The Game is about playing with friends, use the Steam friend list for invites. <br>Use the Steam voice chat or an external tool for communication.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: <strong>Shellborne</strong> is currently in the <u><strong>beta</strong> <strong>phase</strong></u>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shellborne</strong> is a student‑made, completely <strong>free to play</strong>, co‑op adventure—no paywalls, just pure turtle‑powered fun. <br><br>If you want to support us, join our community discord and give us feedback. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1771920394\" width=1094 height=404 /></span>Collect Resources and Remove Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest wood, mine stone, and gather berries,  <br>then load them onto your trusty turtle to carry for you. <br>Smash through debris and rebuild bridges to carve out a safe route for your turtle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.poster.avif?t=1771920394\" width=660 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.webm?t=1771920394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/2aaae2691e2e9321875973dae0846962.mp4?t=1771920394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The evil fog hunts your turtle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living wall of mist moves toward you, hungry for your magical turtle.  <br>It sends Spirits to slow you down - keep them away and keep running. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1771920394\" width=1094 height=404 /></span>Work together and communicate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination is key as you can only carry one tool at a time.<br>Discuss roles and swap gear at the right moment to clear the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The Game is about playing with friends, use the Steam friend list for invites. <br>Use the Steam voice chat or an external tool for communication.  </p>", "short_description": "Shellborne is a chaotic co-op game, where you guide a giant mystical turtle, over a dangerous mountain path. Collect resources and flee from the evil fog.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/be960e73da08f7114ce9b4a14a6051c1c844d756/header.jpg?t=1771920394", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/77e893912095e06ac8b67b0588f3446807f106e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771920394", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/77e893912095e06ac8b67b0588f3446807f106e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771920394", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz equivalent Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong